{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05622","headline":"晚秋赠张折冲 · 薛业","name":"晚秋赠张折冲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"都尉今无事，时清但闭关。\n夜霜戎马瘦，秋草射堂闲。\n位以穿杨得，名因折桂还。\n冯唐真不遇，叹息鬓毛斑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛业","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}